            "verseId": "JER.50.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.18.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Maono 18:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ihani atu ahumirao maha edze apige Babeli, osi awezao kulatsa. Chitani kambi kuizunguluka na musiriche hata mutu mmwenga akachimbira. Iriphizeni kulengana na mahendoge, ihendereni kulengana na vyo irivyohenda. Mana Babeli yamuhendera ngulu Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mtakatifu wa Iziraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa hivyo barobaroe andaolagbwa mo mwakpwe mihalani na anajeshie andaangamizwa siku iyo, Mwenyezi Mlungu anaamba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wa majeshi anaamba, Atu a Iziraeli anaonerwa na a Juda dza vivyo. Osi arioahala mateka akaagbwira ngingingi, anakahala kuarichira auke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela mkomboli wao ana nguvu; dzinare ni Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wa majeshi. Iye andaahehera ili aahende aoye kahi ya yo tsi, ela atu asagalao Babeli asioye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
