                {
                  "text": "Mwandzo 19:24–25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dza viratu Mlungu arivyoangamiza Sodoma na Gomora na midzi yokala phephi, takuna mutu ndiyekusagala tsona,” Mwenyezi Mlungu anaamba.",
          "type": "text",
